        "en": "Overlap between adjacent audio chunks, in seconds; must be smaller than audio_chunk_duration_sec when chunking is enabled. Recommended: 25% of audio_chunk_duration_sec, matching the official Python settings. Overlapping edges are trimmed rather than averaged. Ignored for whole-file inference.",
